 will calculate the CVSS v3.1 base score.\n\n**Vector String**: CVSS:3.1/AV:A/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:L\n\n**Base Score**: 7.5\n\nHere is the output in JSON format:\n\n```\n{\n  \"attack_vector\": \"A\",\n  \"attack_complexity\": \"L\",\n  \"privileges_required\": \"N\",\n  \"user_interaction\": \"R\",\n  \"scope\": \"U\",\n  \"confidentiality_impact\": \"H\",\n  \"integrity_impact\": \"H\",\n  \"availability_impact\": \"L\",\n  \"vector_string\": \"CVSS:3.1/AV:A/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:L\",\n  \"base_score\": 7.5\n}\n```\n\nPlease note that this assessment is based solely on the provided vulnerability description and does not take into account any external knowledge or assumptions.",
